    native_codegen_scope_frees_bootstrap_llvm_name_index_2026-11-09, 0, "Per-module LLVM codegen transient scope frees the lazily-built module-global bootstrap LLVM name index; later modules read a freed array (rejected invalid array handle). Fix: warm index before scope."

